From 05e8c5abb1fa33c1f8c0fa375b1b616557b8ee55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: robbertuittenbroek <robbert.uittenbroek@rijksoverheid.nl>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:02:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] chore: bump golang.org/x/net to v0.62.0 and drop pebble from
 the base image

x/net v0.59.0 carries CVEs fixed in v0.62.0; go mod tidy moves the rest of the x/ family along. Pebble ships with the Ubuntu base outside dpkg, nothing in Argo CD runs it, and it carries Go CVEs of its own.
---
 Dockerfile |  3 ++-
 go.mod     | 14 +++++++-------
 go.sum     | 24 ++++++++++++------------
 3 files changed, 21 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Dockerfile b/Dockerfile
index 2c4b22b21..7170283be 100644
--- a/Dockerfile
+++ b/Dockerfile
@@ -51,7 +51,8 @@ RUN groupadd -g $ARGOCD_USER_ID argocd && \
     apt-get install --no-install-recommends -y \
     git tini ca-certificates gpg gpg-agent tzdata connect-proxy openssh-client && \
     apt-get clean && \
-    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/* /tmp/* /var/tmp/* /usr/share/doc/*
+    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/* /tmp/* /var/tmp/* /usr/share/doc/* && \
+    rm -f /usr/bin/pebble
 
 COPY hack/gpg-wrapper.sh \
     hack/git-verify-wrapper.sh \
